comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T20:19:24.652Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: exact searches for GHSA-6prh-2h8m-c8cw and GHSA-698v-4r3x-3vcv returned zero; full live security parent and closed predecessor records distinguish new component findings from completed follow-redirects remediation. Latest strict all-status read contains 3031 items, no omissions; open/in-progress inventory identifies no active duplicate. https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-6prh-2h8m-c8cw https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-698v-4r3x-3vcv"
  "2026-10-20T20:21:59.678Z","harness:codex","The complete-lock failing-before control queried 569 locked npm versions. Registry audit was zero while OSV reported client 2.2.0 GHSA-6prh-2h8m-c8cw and Vite 7.3.5 GHSA-698v-4r3x-3vcv plus newly published GHSA-587h-7wmj-h5pm (19:48 UTC) and GHSA-r825-w8mm-5pxw (19:51 UTC). Authoritative advisory records confirm the same Vite 7.3.7 patch addresses all three. This extends the existing component item, without duplicate intake."
  "2026-10-20T20:30:43.811Z","harness:codex","New Dependabot PR #1525 proposes the same Vite 7.3.7 lockfile update. Its diff is limited to pnpm-lock.yaml and is covered by this canonical security item; do not create duplicate PM work. The combined security delivery also raises the override floor and patches the MCP client/core graph. Once the combined PR lands, confirm the bot PR is superseded and closed. Twelve linked native bundle, real loopback CodSpeed runtime, and MCP Apps tests pass on the patched graph."
